<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN WOMENS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN WOMENS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results on in the</p>
<p>Pan-Pacific Open women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Ludmilla Varmuzova (San Marino) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Henrietta Nagyova (Slovakia) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>1-Stefi Graf (Germany) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>2-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat GLoria Pizzichini (Italy)</p>
<p>6-1 6-0</p>
<p>7-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
</text>
